Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:40.92,Neige,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.11,0:10:46.30,Default2,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.29,0:10:57.41,Default2,,0,0,0,,歌的碎片在起反应 水萌 篝 流星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.11,0:11:14.99,Neige,,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,超越
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.29,0:11:35.36,Neige,,0,0,0,,哈哈 哈哈...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.17,0:11:38.44,Ripple,,0,0,0,,赢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:49.58,Default2,,0,0,0,,我们见证了 你们的音悦力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.24,0:11:52.50,Default2,,0,0,0,,果然是非同凡响
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:56.44,Default2,,0,0,0,,虽然还不足以打倒我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.85,0:11:58.46,Zeal,,0,0,0,,这都不行吗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.67,0:12:01.81,Meteor,,0,0,0,,喂喂 没招了吗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:06.93,Neige,,0,0,0,,不 放弃还太早了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:08.57,Ripple,,0,0,0,,百合？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:11.57,Viola,,0,0,0,,就在刚才 是你们教会我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:16.14,Viola,,0,0,0,,即使不能变身公主 我们的音悦力量...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.03,0:12:24.79,Neige,,0,0,0,,我们不是成为公主 才提升的音悦力量
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:28.90,Neige,,0,0,0,,是因为提升了音悦力量 才能成为公主
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.62,Ripple,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:38.30,Ripple,,0,0,0,,音悦力量 一直都给予我们勇气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:41.27,Ripple,,0,0,0,,还没有结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.73,0:12:46.22,Ripple,,0,0,0,,上吧 大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:47.15,Zeal,,0,0,0,,诶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:47.65,Meteor,,0,0,0,,收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.81,0:12:48.75,Neige,,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:52.98,Default2,,0,0,0,,来吧 接着想让我们听哪首歌？
Comment: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.98,Default2,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.99,0:12:58.46,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HC6EA2A&}歩いてきた道に花が咲き
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:04.66,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HAE85E8&}結び合う想いは嵐を越え
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:10.23,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&H44FFF6&}重ねた思い出が 夜明けまで
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:16.45,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}連れ立って 見せたのは 奇跡の空
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.39,0:13:16.45,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,110,1920,1080)}{\1c&HDD8A96&}連れ立って 見せたのは 奇跡の空
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.48,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\1c&HDD8A96&}逃げなかった過去が繋いだ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:22.44,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HFFB8FF&}絆に 導かれてく
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:25.49,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HAE85E8&}痛みの分だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:28.07,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&H44FFF6&}強くなって {\c&HC6EA2A&}思いやって
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:30.50,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}前を見つめ
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.24,0:13:30.50,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,110,1920,1080)}{\1c&HDD8A96&}前を見つめ
