Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.40,0:13:36.63,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,110,1920,1080)}{\1c&HDD8A96&}FUTURE SESSION
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.80,0:13:45.42,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}どんな 時も「今」を 大切 に響かせながら
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.80,0:13:45.42,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,110,1920,1080)}{\1c&HDD8A96&}どんな 時も「今」を 大切 に響かせながら
