Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.99,0:12:58.46,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HC6EA2A&}走过的道路 百花盛开
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:04.66,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HAE85E8&}相系的感情 超越风暴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:10.23,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&H44FFF6&}共筑起回忆 直到黎明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:16.45,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,0,1920,36)}{\c&HC6EA2A&}携手屹立 眼中所见 是奇迹天空
