Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:19.48,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\1c&HDD8A96&}无法逃避的过去 连接彼此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.65,0:13:22.44,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HFFB8FF&}友情指引我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.64,0:13:25.49,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&HAE85E8&}越感到痛楚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:28.07,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\c&H44FFF6&}便越是坚强 {\c&HC6EA2A&}信念更坚定
