Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.80,0:13:45.42,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,36,1920,46)}{\c&H44FFF6&}无论何时 都要珍重地唱响“当下”
Dialogue: 2,0:13:36.80,0:13:45.42,LIVE Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\clip(0,46,1920,1080)}{\c&HAE85E8&}无论何时 都要珍重地唱响“当下”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:56.98,Default2,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.71,0:13:11.36,Default2,,0,0,0,,这是 水萌她们的音悦力量正在共鸣吗!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:14.87,Default2,,0,0,0,,阻止那首歌 豪夺乐队！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:20.20,Default2,,0,0,0,,没错 这次要让我们见证！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:23.52,Default2,,0,0,0,,你们5人 倾注全部心力的音悦力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.49,0:13:32.15,Default2,,0,0,0,,休想得逞... 呜哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.18,Default2,,0,0,0,,怎么会...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:48.75,Ripple,,0,0,0,,我们的歌的碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.93,0:13:52.75,Meteor,,0,0,0,,厉害... 比以前都要来得闪亮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:56.55,Zeal,,0,0,0,,是的吧 都是一直相伴在身边的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.80,0:13:59.66,Neige,,0,0,0,,我跟姐姐 和...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:03.01,Viola,,0,0,0,,托马的心愿结晶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:08.61,Ripple,,0,0,0,,就算被夺走无数次
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:11.26,Ripple,,0,0,0,,这份感情也无法消除
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:09.33,Default2,,0,0,0,,我们就期盼着这一时刻 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:12.41,Default2,,0,0,0,,来吧 用那姿态做出证明！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.86,0:16:16.20,Default2,,0,0,0,,你们够格站在王的面前！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:19.21,Meteor,,0,0,0,,他不凹造型 就不能说话是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:21.78,Ripple,,0,0,0,,一直都这样的吧
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:27.75,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,もう一度見せてみろ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:30.38,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,凌駕する強さを
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:33.58,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,全身全霊を込めて
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:35.20,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,【Band Snatch!!!!】
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:39.93,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,進み続ける意志 しかと胸に
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.05,0:16:44.34,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,決して離さずに
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,『奏で合おう! 進化のその先を!』
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:54.33,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,全てを超えろ
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:55.63,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,己をも
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:56.88,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,そのチカラで
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:58.22,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,何処までも
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:03.05,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,何一つ変わらない想いを抱いて
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:08.16,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,リバイバルは此処に 伝説へと
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:18.13,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,再び 授かった この命 存分に今 歌え!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,LIVE Snatch Jp,,0,0,0,,永遠に We are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:27.75,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,再来见识一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:30.38,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,凌驾于你的强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.54,0:16:33.58,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,全身全心地投入
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:35.20,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,【豪夺乐队!!!!】
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.36,0:16:39.93,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,不断前进的意志 贯彻在心中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.05,0:16:44.34,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,绝对不会松开手
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,“共奏吧！进化的尽头”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:54.33,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,超越一切
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:55.63,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,超越自我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:56.88,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,以那力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:58.22,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,驰骋天涯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:03.05,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,都要紧拥不变的理念
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:08.16,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,在此复活 铸就传说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.32,0:17:18.13,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,又再一次 被授予的 这条生命 现在尽情 歌唱起来！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,LIVE Snatch,,0,0,0,,我们永远地歌唱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:40.37,Default2,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿！就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:42.92,Default2,,0,0,0,,相互消耗到极限的对邦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:42.92,Default2,,430,0,0,,{\fs50}乐队对决
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.32,0:16:45.63,Default2,,0,0,0,,就是我们在这里的理由！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.97,0:16:49.52,Default2,,0,0,0,,来吧 高潮开始了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.89,0:16:52.40,Default2,,0,0,0,,刻印在心中吧 公主！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\fs50}永远都要第一个为我助威哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,水萌...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题的问题... 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,水萌！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.54,0:17:56.28,Ripple,,0,0,0,,我... 我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.44,0:18:00.70,Ripple,,0,0,0,,有一个人 一定要跟他交谈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.84,Ripple,,0,0,0,,有一个人 等着我回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.37,0:18:10.28,Ripple,,0,0,0,,不能止步在这里的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.89,0:18:14.89,Ripple,,0,0,0,,所以 要超越你们！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.43,0:18:18.17,Default2,,0,0,0,,光靠拼劲 还是没法结束
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.56,0:18:21.36,Default2,,0,0,0,,不过 这也是风中残... 什么!?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:36.39,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}離れない 離さない 何度も言うよ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:39.72,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}想いは絆へ
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:41.89,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}We are We are We are We are
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:46.12,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}（響け 永遠に）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.94,0:18:49.78,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}過去に愛を 現在に光を
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:52.88,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}未来には祝福を
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.03,0:18:59.03,LIVE Default Jp,,0,0,0,,{\an9}{\clip(0,0,1920,110)}{\c&HFFB8FF&}優しく 握り返す 時を越えて
